        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>更年期健康知识可视化 — 健康生活方式</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #d9d9d6;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #e8e8e5;\n    padding: 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .col-left { width: 258px; }\n  .col-right { width: 274px; }\n\n  .red { color: #e8443c; }\n  .sec-title {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #e8443c;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .sec-title::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 6px; height: 6px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e8443c;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .sub-title {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .sub-title::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 4px; height: 4px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e8443c;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .block {\n    border-top: 1px solid #b4b4b0;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .block.first { border-top: none; padding-top: 0; margin-top: 0; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 4px 0; text-align: justify; }\n\n  /* icon grids */\n  .icon-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 6px 4px;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .icon-cell .placeholder { margin: 0 auto 2px auto; }\n  .icon-cell span { font-size: 10px; }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #dcdcd8;\n    border: 1px dashed #a8a8a4;\n    color: #6e6e6a;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* exercise amount */\n  .amount-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .amount-left { flex: 1; }\n  .amount-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .amount-item .num { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .amount-right {\n    width: 108px;\n    background: #dcdcd8;\n    padding: 5px;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .swatches { display: flex; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .swatches div { height: 12px; flex: 1; }\n\n  /* BMI bar */\n  .bmi-wrap { margin: 10px 0 4px 0; }\n  .bmi-bar { display: flex; height: 16px; }\n  .bmi-bar .seg1 { width: 26%; background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#c9c9c5 0 3px,#e8e8e5 3px 6px); }\n  .bmi-bar .seg2 { width: 40%; background: #1a1a1a; }\n  .bmi-bar .seg3 { width: 34%; background: #e8443c; }\n  .bmi-marks { display: flex; font-size: 9px; color: #e8443c; }\n  .bmi-marks span:first-child { width: 26%; text-align: right; }\n  .bmi-marks span:last-child { width: 40%; text-align: right; }\n  .bmi-caption { text-align: center; font-size: 9px; margin-top: 2px; }\n\n  .formula { font-size: 9px; margin: 8px 0 4px 0; }\n  .gauge-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }\n  .gauge-text { font-size: 9.5px; }\n\n  /* right column */\n  .r-header { text-align: right; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .food-wheel { position: relative; height: 330px; }\n  .label-box {\n    background: #e8e8e5;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 3px 6px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .label-box b { font-size: 11px; }\n  .lbl { position: absolute; z-index: 3; }\n  .l-grain { top: 4px; left: 88px; }\n  .l-veg { top: 62px; left: 8px; }\n  .l-fruit { top: 138px; left: 8px; }\n  .l-milk { top: 218px; left: 8px; }\n  .l-animal { top: 285px; left: 118px; }\n  .wheel-ph { position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 0; width: 232px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; }\n\n  .principles { border-top: 1px solid #b4b4b0; padding-top: 8px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .principles p { margin-bottom: 3px; }\n\n  .big-title { text-align: right; margin-top: 14px; }\n  .big-title div {\n    font-size: 44px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n  }\n  .tagline {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    border-top: 2px solid #333;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 4px 0;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- ================= LEFT COLUMN ================= -->\n  <div class=\"col-left\">\n\n    <div class=\"block first\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\">运动健身</h2>\n\n      <h3 class=\"sub-title\">运动的益处</h3>\n      <p>适宜的运动有益健康，可以降低体脂肪的供能比例，可以改善脂质代谢，对维持正常血压、降低血清胆固醇水平、提高心肺功能都有积极作用。运动还可以改善人体心理状态、有助于消除焦虑。</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"sub-title\">推荐运动</h3>\n      <div class=\"icon-grid\">\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px;height:44px;\">[图标: 自行车]</div>\n          <span>自行车</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px;height:44px;\">[图标: 游泳]</div>\n          <span>游泳</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px;height:44px;\">[图标: 慢跑]</div>\n          <span>慢跑</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px;height:44px;\">[图标: 广场舞]</div>\n          <span>广场舞</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px;height:44px;\">[图标: 瑜伽]</div>\n          <span>瑜伽</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px;height:44px;\">[图标: 太极]</div>\n          <span>太极</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>更年期妇女在运动锻炼中应尽量避免肌肉-关节-骨骼系统损伤，合理进行有氧运动、条件合适可以适量进行肌肉力量锻炼。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\">推荐运动量</h2>\n      <div class=\"amount-row\">\n        <div class=\"amount-left\">\n          <div class=\"amount-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;\">[图标: 脚印]</div>\n            <span class=\"num\">6000步</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"amount-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;\">[图标: 心形]</div>\n            <span class=\"num\">150次/min</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"amount-right\">\n          <div class=\"swatches\">\n            <div style=\"background:#f0efe9;\"></div>\n            <div style=\"background:#dcd9c8;\"></div>\n            <div style=\"background:#b8b3a0;\"></div>\n            <div style=\"background:#8f8a78;\"></div>\n            <div style=\"background:#5f5b50;\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\">\n            <div style=\"flex:1;\">锻炼最佳方式与每周至少3次<br>每周时长为30min/次</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:30px;height:34px;\">[图标: 手臂]</div>\n          </div>\n          <div>每周进行2－3次肌肉训练</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\">维持体重</h2>\n      <p>随着年龄的增长，人体的基础代谢率将逐渐下降，另外，雌激素分泌的减少将进一步降低女性的基础代谢率，40－49岁时可降低5%、50－59岁时可降低10%。从而使体脂肪人更容易转化为脂肪并在体内积累。维持正常体重有利于更年期女性健康。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"bmi-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"bmi-bar\">\n          <div class=\"seg1\"></div>\n          <div class=\"seg2\"></div>\n          <div class=\"seg3\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bmi-marks\"><span>18.5</span><span>23.9</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bmi-caption\">更年期女性建议BMI</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula\">计算公式：BMI=体重/身高的平方(国际单位kg/㎡)</div>\n\n      <div class=\"gauge-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:118px;height:56px;background:#1a1a1a;color:#e8e8e5;border-color:#1a1a1a;\">[图示: 体重计/仪表]</div>\n        <div class=\"gauge-text\">肥胖妇女体重若减轻<br>5%～10%，就能有效改<br>善与肥胖相关的多种异<br>常状况。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\">其他</h2>\n      <div class=\"icon-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);\">\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:48px;height:40px;\">[图标: 睡眠]</div>\n          <span>足量睡眠</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:48px;height:40px;\">[图标: 避孕]</div>\n          <span>注意避孕</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:48px;height:40px;\">[图标: 戒烟]</div>\n          <span>戒烟</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"icon-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:48px;height:40px;\">[图标: 戒酒]</div>\n          <span>戒酒</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= RIGHT COLUMN ================= -->\n  <div class=\"col-right\">\n\n    <div class=\"r-header\">更年期健康知识可视化</div>\n\n    <div class=\"food-wheel\">\n      <div class=\"wheel-ph placeholder\">[信息图: 圆形食物分类轮盘，右侧居中]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"lbl l-grain\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\"><b>谷类</b><br>每天250－400g<br>粗粮与杂豆50－150g</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:80px;height:12px;margin-top:3px;\">[图标: 数量点]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lbl l-veg\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\"><b>蔬菜</b><br>每天300－500g</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:80px;height:12px;margin-top:3px;\">[图标: 数量点]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lbl l-fruit\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\"><b>水果</b><br>每天200－400g</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:80px;height:12px;margin-top:3px;\">[图标: 数量点]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lbl l-milk\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\"><b>奶</b><br>每天300g</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lbl l-animal\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\"><b>动物性食物</b><br>每天120－200g</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"principles\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\">基本原则</h2>\n      <p>控制总能量在1800－1900千卡，饮食适量均衡饮食，该年龄段较年轻妇女可适当减少能量。</p>\n      <p>限制脂肪，控制过多脂肪的摄入，避免摄入油炸、油煎的食物。</p>\n      <p>充足重白供给，选择低脂乳制品、瘦肉、豆制品、鱼类等。</p>\n      <p>调整碳水化合物来源种类，多选择富含膳食纤维的全谷类、蔬菜、低糖水果。</p>\n      <p>定时定量、细嚼慢咽,拒绝压力性进食或者焦虑期用进食缓解</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"big-title\">\n      <div>健康</div>\n      <div>生活方式</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tagline\">了解更年期有益健康的生活习惯</div>\n\n    <p>根据更年期身体特点培养良好的生活习惯、倡导整体的、预防为先的保健理念、帮助妇女减少更年期相关不良事件及疾病的发生，促进身心健康。</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
